Base: AetherEngine 7.61.0, d612bedb3e60f8bc403c646fe44c0a852ee8a995
License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3, with the upstream
Apple Store / DRM Exception. Upstream copyright and license notices are retained.

Changes: RPU mapping-ID reuse, fixed-point FEL reconstruction and MMR coefficient
precision, regression tests, and an opt-in luma resampling comparison.

Corresponding engine source: the upstream commit above plus this patch.
Upstream: https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine
Modifications and preparation/build scripts: https://github.com/rohanpandula/reference-player
Use PrivateBuild/engine-patches and PrivateBuild/engine.py from the same app revision.
See README.md beside this patch for preparation, modification and rebuild instructions.

